# Makepad 2 faces (selection + truncation)

Canonical docs: `docs/DEV.md` § **Makepad 2 UI faces (agent guide)** · `docs/DESIGN.md` § Makepad 2 faces.

Same UI ships to Linux / Windows / Android — change shared faces in `apps/courier`, not per OS.

## Cause (regressions we already paid for)

Makepad 2 `Button` has **no selected bit** — only `hover` / `down` / `focus` / `disabled` animators.

| Failure | Cause |
|---|---|
| Several bottom tabs look active | Idle `TabBtn` used the **same navy fill** on hover/focus as `TabBtnActive`; focus also stuck after click |
| Sell lit while Buy/More shows | Selection inferred from focus/hover instead of `Screen` via `paint_nav_tabs` |
| Label clipped on the right | Full-width CTA with `max_lines: 1` + `Ellipsis`, or multi-word text in `ChipBtn` (Fit max 160) |
| Button shows `record_purchase` | Missing English `locale::en` entry; `t()` returned the key |

## Approach (required)

### Selection

1. Overlay **idle + active** faces (not one Button whose hover means selected).
2. Idle face must **not** reuse the active fill on hover/down/focus (nav idle = transparent).
3. Paint from app state: `paint_nav_tabs` / `paint_choice_pair` (+ `clear_button_animators` every time).
4. Bottom nav: exactly one peer from `nav_tab_for(screen)`; More children → **More**.
5. Nav tabs: `grab_key_focus: false`, `reset_hover_on_click: true`.

### Labels

| Labels | Face |
|---|---|
| Short strip chip | `ChipBtn` / `ChipBtnActive` (ellipsis OK) |
| Ultra-short side-by-side | `ActionRow` + `Row*` |
| Multi-word / translated | `ActionStack` + `Stack*`, or `NavBtn` / `PayBtn` / `MoreRow` (wrap, **no** ellipsis) |
| Side-by-side fields only | `FormFieldRow` (equal `Fill` inputs — **no** CTAs) |

Always `padding` **and** `label_walk.margin`. Never invent `LangSourceBtn`-style one-offs.

### Form rows (Makepad has no flex-shrink)

`NavBtn` / `Stack*` use `flow: Right{wrap: true}`. A **Fit** CTA beside **Fill** `FieldInput`s in one `Right` row is given a tiny width → wrap stacks letters vertically (`A d d r a t e`) and overlaps the field. That is not a theme bug.

```text
❌ FormFieldRow / Right row: FieldInput + FieldInput + NavBtn{width: Fit}
❌ “Just this screen” one-off Fit primary beside fills

✅ FormFieldRow{ FieldInput; FieldInput }
✅ ActionStack{ StackSecondaryBtn; StackPrimaryBtn } under the fields
```

```text
❌ Idle TabBtn color_hover = #072058 (same as TabBtnActive)
❌ Focus/hover as the selected look
❌ Ellipsis on NavBtn/MoreRow; ChipBtn for “Tax invoice” / language source
❌ Fix one call site only — edit the shared face

✅ Overlay + paint_nav_tabs / paint_choice_pair + animator clear
✅ Wrap on full-width CTAs; ChipBtn only for short chips
✅ Fields in FormFieldRow; multi-word CTAs in ActionStack below
```
